ReasonforDeviation_Summary:
The percentage target was affected by:
•	The multiple supplier effect;
•	Shortage of supplier for certain categories of commodities.

ReasonforDeviation_Q3:
1) Unreasonably long postponements of cases requested / sick leave of officials; 
2) Dependency on witnesses who are public members, and don't want to avail themselves for cases due to intimidation; 
3) Load shedding as some matters are conducted virtual, whereas in-person hearings are costly; 
4) Presiding Officers not complying with turn-around-times in submitting verdicts / sanctions; 
5) Complexity of cases; 
6) Disputes of interpretation of the DC and P, and use of legal practitioners to initiate / chair cases for staff on SL 1 - 12; 
and 
7) Budget.
